            {
              "id": "cd2f02c7",
              "elType": "widget",
              "settings": {
                "title": "About this demonstration",
                "header_size": "h2"
              },
              "elements": [],
              "widgetType": "heading"
            },
            {
              "id": "7580ae05",
              "elType": "widget",
              "settings": {
                "editor": "<p>ForgeLine Steel is a fictional coursework business. This local site is intended for demonstration and editing. Project studies, contact details, and business descriptions are illustrative.</p>"
              },
              "elements": [],
              "widgetType": "text-editor"
            },
            {
              "id": "1f545c3a",
              "elType": "widget",
              "settings": {
                "title": "Enquiry information",
                "header_size": "h2"
              },
              "elements": [],
              "widgetType": "heading"
            },
            {
              "id": "687c18d1",
              "elType": "widget",
              "settings": {
                "editor": "<p>The enquiry form stores your name, email, company, chosen service, and message in the WordPress database so the site administrator can review them. Only authorized administrators can access saved enquiries. Do not submit sensitive or confidential information to this demonstration.</p>"
              },
              "elements": [],
              "widgetType": "text-editor"
            },
            {
              "id": "3a580b24",
              "elType": "widget",
              "settings": {
                "editor": "<p>Email is disabled by default. If a future owner enables notifications, enquiry information will also be sent to the configured recipient. The final owner must replace this notice with their actual controller, retention period, lawful basis, and contact details before public launch.</p>"
              },
              "elements": [],
              "widgetType": "text-editor"
            },
            {
              "id": "defc63e5",
              "elType": "widget",
              "settings": {
                "title": "Cookies and external services",
                "header_size": "h2"
              },
              "elements": [],
              "widgetType": "heading"
            },
            {
              "id": "57318a78",
              "elType": "widget",
              "settings": {
                "editor": "<p>The public design does not add analytics, advertising pixels, or an embedded map. WordPress uses essential cookies when administrators sign in. Images and fonts are bundled locally. Hosting providers may keep technical request logs.</p>"
              },
              "elements": [],
              "widgetType": "text-editor"
            },
            {
              "id": "d5ea581c",
              "elType": "widget",
              "settings": {
                "title": "Image credits",
                "header_size": "h2"
              },
              "elements": [],
              "widgetType": "heading"
            },
            {
              "id": "d3ce27f6",
              "elType": "widget",
              "settings": {
                "editor": "<p>Workshop and hero photography: <a href=\"https://unsplash.com/@christopher__burns\">Christopher Burns</a>, <a href=\"https://unsplash.com/@roblambertjr\">Rob Lambert</a>, and <a href=\"https://unsplash.com/@ig_joshabeech\">Josh Beech</a>. Structural photography: <a href=\"https://unsplash.com/@dkphotos22\">D R</a> and <a href=\"https://unsplash.com/@iamr\">Roman Serdyuk</a>. Images sourced through Unsplash and used for illustration.</p>"
              },
              "elements": [],
              "widgetType": "text-editor"
            },
            {
              "id": "d50221d6",
              "elType": "widget",
              "settings": {
                "title": "Original identity & theme",
                "header_size": "h2"
              },
              "elements": [],
              "widgetType": "heading"
            },
            {
              "id": "ae20bd1c",
              "elType": "widget",
              "settings": {
                "editor": "<p>The ForgeLine Steel logo is an original editable SVG supplied with this project. The site uses the supplied Hubsteel theme with a ForgeLine child theme and the Elementor editor. Theme and third-party assets retain their respective license terms.</p>"
              },
              "elements": [],
              "widgetType": "text-editor"
            }
